Two Lua events, `input.touch.down` (point, touch id) and `input.tablet.tip` (point,
after the cursor warp), so a config can react to finger and pen presses, which never
pass through mouse binds (features/sidedock's click-to-front on a back card).

diff -ruN a/src/config/lua/LuaEventHandler.cpp b/src/config/lua/LuaEventHandler.cpp
